#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1376 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "Same DM rows 1-2 (ARM1/(empty), NOTTRT/(empty)); TS carries TITLE + ONGOSIND/Y rows -> count=1 -> exception silences row 1."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM class="SPECIAL PURPOSE"
col STUDYID   type=Char
col DOMAIN    type=Char
col USUBJID   type=Char
col ACTARMCD  type=Char
col RFENDTC   type=Char
---
S1 | DM | 001 | ARM1   |
S1 | DM | 002 | NOTTRT  |
---

dataset TS class="TRIAL DESIGN"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
---
S1 | TS | 1 | TITLE    | Example Study
S1 | TS | 2 | ONGOSIND | Y
